stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PendingPayment: 创建订单
  PendingPayment --> Paid: 支付确认且订单可接受
  PendingPayment --> Cancelled: 用户取消或支付期限到期
  Paid --> Fulfillment: 启动履约
  Fulfillment --> Completed: 签收确认
  Completed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
  note right of Cancelled
    迟到支付通知不复活订单
    进入支付核对及补偿流程
  end note
